LWF-YOLO is a research repository derived from the Ultralytics YOLO codebase.

Original LWF-YOLO contributions are concentrated in the custom architecture, model config, and DCNv3-backed detection
head integration described in `docs/custom_modules.md`.

The repository is released under AGPL-3.0 because it contains derivative source code from the AGPL-licensed
Ultralytics project.
